 "structural_change": "S81U-BK2: the bk units become WIRES-ONLY clusters of hard children (closed dsfd_colt_lane x4 + dsfd_colt_mrg; closed dsfd_selt_q2 x4 + dsfd_selt_c) instead of flattened leaves (col 50,134 sinks / sel_lm 30,768 on one root). This is the ONLY new logic: one glue leaf master (vstop + V ingress + V egress, ~5.5k flops, 2 SRAM) shared by both units (straps captured). Pins: rung S side on S, rung N side + vd (from the merger / control above) on N, lane words W pair on W, E pair on E (to the lane relays).",
